  Id: UpgradeTower
  Title: Two kinds of upgrades
  Pages:
  - 'GLOBAL: Tab 2 unlocks the next catalog tier for FUTURE purchases. Towers already
    placed stay at their current tier.'
  - 'INDIVIDUAL: Select a placed tower and choose Upgrade. Only that instance changes,
    its health percentage is preserved, and its foundation/grid cell remain attached.
    This costs less than its global upgrade.'
